{"title":"2001 JBMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d320d56558d3680da6f97756f5a311548ea8afaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + b^3 + c^3 = 2001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"151\" height=\"16\" /> in positive integers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution1\">Solution1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/4/c54e7152acd659788861f0453ac195c635e0a005.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> the value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4ba37f50c674bcbae995ed1d9dfd4beb5e53c765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa52acd39eb0dc3d8250f2eb6b464e67abd8bf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1,0,1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modulo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modulo\">modulo</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a1b9d5cec741422bfb37f91db47fd7514f5377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\nProof: set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/3/823297f40197d0f86854c6d3f0f8c3a96ab178e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 3k + a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" /> Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/e/0bedc12c93cd19349267702b219aadfd4206099d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3 \\equiv 27k^3 + 27k^2a + 9ka^2 + a^3 \\equiv a^3 \\pmod{9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"364\" height=\"21\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/0/9c00f2d6309c3ad2eff4955ea48580cac28ef586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0, n^3 \\equiv 0^3 \\pmod{9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"21\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/a/14afb38ec450bff8ab358d6de2473e6925e9914f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1, n^3 \\equiv 1^3 \\pmod{9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"21\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab78054d654a9d9be97b3633bb5d6608e8bd889e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2, n^3 \\equiv 2^3 \\equiv -1 \\pmod{9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"237\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><br />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79d53d28d4c6b5552a9d0ddc1bf2e7f1e4a7903.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2001 \\equiv 3 \\pmod{9},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" /> we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad09e3fb0dfc322f2f2bff1aced48615194cc48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3,b^3,c^3 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"172\" height=\"19\" /> Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b8c1c5544183d3622343bbbc1c04aa9102371c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c \\equiv 1 \\pmod{3},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" /> and the only numbers congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca7688a8e6057b9c4b72bf36b321c34ac2c4145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,4,7,10.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=WLOG\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"WLOG\">WLOG</a>, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9e8a9a48259c6d1b3e1ca2121dabbf2fcc57098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge b \\ge c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b8e1cca5c44613a72077d2a259f2eaa53ab42d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 \\ge b^3, c^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/390ea478ff8c60d08f7cc14a5975a0a58f7b47fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a^3 \\ge 2001.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37ea034dcc2bc42a028bf3bff30ff1860e03ef99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 \\ge 667,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b868737fa8c96a9aeffb2bfb2fa31488ab1b58f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 10.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><br />\nNow <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/9/3d92505a5241f6404ce9fed4c4b4c9007e09609c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^3 + c^3 = 1001.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/2390626ea691e703bbb15a3dae8ab2b76843af54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^3 \\ge c^3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" /> we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57eca92728bc94b35ad1838f58c6a7943bcea816.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b^3 \\ge 1001.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"17\" />  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a7203b7e6f070ba402b9cd45dee2bfc125164fd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/0/c600fc32822186112e113b0e34287a7c4154d43a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><br />\nIn summary, the only solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbb5c9a21fd43fa29e47d02fcad2280d8d5e84a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(10,10,1),(10,1,10),(1,10,10)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"258\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution2\">Solution2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You can also watch remainders modulo 7 which are also -1,0,1. The rest is almost identical as in solution 1.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO\" title=\"2001 JBMO\">2001 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"2001 JBMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017195402\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 174/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 839/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 43/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5052/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.608      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%    6.608      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16630:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017195402 and revision id 247699. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}